{"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.063917522430419926,"y":0.046388726027300708,"t":"Test 2","x":0.89072165104939494,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"COLIN:","x":0.057731958769587734,"y":0.093023256050192238,"w":0.049484535853068036,"h":0.010174418083723991,"c":1},{"t":"HELEN:","x":0.059769902641092741,"y":0.10894382559480076,"c":1,"w":0.049532359441121436,"h":0.0088565348178865078},{"w":0.045360822677612309,"x":0.059793814778032348,"y":0.14098837218391314,"t":"COLIN:","h":0.010174418083724102,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.19040697686927244,"w":0.053608245849609361,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"x":0.057731959446329327,"t":"HELEN:"},{"x":0.057731958770014614,"t":"COLIN:","y":0.22238372105452897,"w":0.049484535853068022,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1},{"x":0.055610581320683486,"h":0.010502494368494375,"c":1,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.055789146423339847,"y":0.23820805512113707},{"t":"COLIN:","h":0.0099594196850457672,"x":0.057404012353745641,"y":0.25333648023665667,"w":0.050089677174886056,"c":1},{"x":0.057667243562016281,"w":0.051675821940104165,"c":1,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.00910857867578585,"y":0.28614338506173553},{"t":"COLIN:","y":0.30212125693652525,"h":0.0091295791106299484,"c":1,"x":0.05765449431157979,"w":0.045515753428141278},{"h":0.011627907341393184,"w":0.053608245849609368,"y":0.3343023253737929,"t":"HELEN:","c":1,"x":0.055670103771743959},{"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"w":0.049484535853068029,"t":"COLIN:","x":0.055670103104393812,"y":0.38226744198389984},{"x":0.057731958770014614,"y":0.39825581407778476,"w":0.049484535853068022,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.055670103563206202,"t":"COLIN:","w":0.047422679265340176,"y":0.4302325583778801,"h":0.010174418083724102},{"t":"HELEN:","w":0.04963641802469889,"x":0.057656017684545778,"h":0.0091587834965811687,"c":1,"y":0.44600200358063624},{"x":0.05345822015358067,"w":0.049784590403238925,"h":0.010923755217914444,"c":1,"y":0.52578812236846417,"t":"COLIN:"},{"h":0.010174418083724102,"y":0.55813953512383563,"w":0.053608245849609382,"t":"HELEN:","x":0.053608248101999434,"c":1},{"w":0.047422679265340169,"t":"COLIN:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"y":0.57412790709704931,"x":0.055670103552354334},{"x":0.055670102636616835,"c":1,"w":0.051546392440795903,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.010174418083723991,"y":0.59011627930811272},{"c":1,"x":0.055608260499686535,"h":0.0090758692707234578,"t":"HELEN:","y":0.64662485604258246,"w":0.049608221054077153},{"w":0.049484535853068029,"h":0.010174418083723991,"c":1,"x":0.053608247429808437,"t":"COLIN:","y":0.69476744209881047},{"c":1,"h":0.0088016501049819063,"t":"HELEN:","x":0.053594541081856399,"y":0.71071545399893976,"w":0.051573804219563806},{"x":0.055519019295136855,"y":0.74237153132683931,"h":0.010896472180512706,"w":0.047724847793579099,"c":1,"t":"COLIN:"},{"y":0.76011051358954529,"h":0.0088487402243399016,"x":0.05358743574923408,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.053649870554606127,"c":1},{"w":0.41855669657389316,"t":"In our aims? But we weren't really looking at that.","x":0.12577319801979969,"y":0.091569767489703247,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.1257731923648753,"t":"I suppose not. OK, now there's the list of equipment we all had to bring on the field","y":0.10745742810503445,"w":0.70103093465169275},{"t":"trip. What did they tell us to bring a ruler for?","x":0.12577319445392712,"w":0.37731959025065109,"h":0.015988371754420694,"y":0.12209302342011885,"c":1},{"y":0.1394597771350089,"h":0.01614797416324143,"w":0.68453608194986981,"c":1,"x":0.12783505172302512,"t":"It was something about measuring the slope of the shore, but of course we didn't"},{"w":0.70103093465169275,"h":0.015988371754420583,"x":0.12577319235325396,"y":0.15552325598034789,"c":1,"t":"need it because we were measuring wind direction, and we'd brought the compass"},{"c":1,"x":0.12511848826762026,"y":0.17007621417838892,"t":"for that...","w":0.088086833953857441,"h":0.015444631234940109},{"t":"But not the piece of string to hold up in the air! Didniạit Mr Blake make a fUSs about us.","c":1,"x":0.12778010310013618,"y":0.18612393929115123,"w":0.72382680257161458,"h":0.017394521694216958},{"t":"Q22","h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.18604651149738416,"c":1,"w":0.049484535853068001,"x":0.84742268054769287},{"c":1,"x":0.12577319629226608,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.20346447427822234,"t":"leaving that behind.","w":0.16907216389973956},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.12577319917501217,"t":"Yeah. He does go on. Anyway it was easy to get one from another of the students.","c":1,"y":0.21947674423584662,"w":0.69896906534830727},{"t":"Now, the next section's the procedure. I sent you the draft of that.","x":0.12577319314698102,"y":0.23546511644524837,"w":0.55463918050130201,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1},{"t":"Yeah. It was clear, but Ldon't think we need all these details of what time we left and.","y":0.24997284613866955,"w":0.72590627034505206,"x":0.12570392250499415,"h":0.01873682809450028,"c":1},{"w":0.62886596679687501,"c":1,"y":0.26598837206246984,"h":0.015988371754420694,"x":0.12577320539022216,"t":"what time we got back and how we divided up the different research tasks"},{"c":1,"t":"OK. I'Il look at that again.","y":0.2833235465183972,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.21649485270182289,"x":0.12577319209401527},{"y":0.29941860470051307,"t":"Then we have to describe our method of investigation in detail. Solet's begin with","w":0.69278350830078128,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.12577319417328178,"c":1},{"t":"Q24","w":0.039175256093343158,"c":1,"x":0.85773195955407833,"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.29941860452658597},{"t":"how we measured wave speed. I was surprised how straightforward that was","c":1,"x":0.12577318974538115,"y":0.3153258954354603,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.65567011515299489},{"x":0.12577320476880743,"y":0.33139534855879549,"t":"I'd expected us to have some sort of high-tech device, not just stand there, and.","w":0.67422678629557287,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1},{"y":0.34732824434884235,"x":0.12577318564259021,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.70309280395507812,"t":"count the number of waves per minute. Not very precise, but I suppose it was good","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.58762888590494788,"t":"enough. But the way we measured the amount of salt was interesting","x":0.12577318606407517,"y":0.36337209318203845,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"In the water from the rock pools?","w":0.28247423807779948,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.12371133447798902,"y":0.37933059326049023},{"y":0.39534883737617377,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"x":0.12371134718191239,"w":0.68247421264648445,"t":"Yeah, oh, I wanted to check the chemicals we used in the lab when we analysed"},{"t":"those samples - was it potassium chromate and silver nitrate?","y":0.41133294205949611,"w":0.52783503214518224,"c":1,"x":0.12577320549659995,"h":0.013211978860833917},{"h":0.014252673298628005,"c":1,"x":0.12549834040616073,"y":0.42765691717309584,"t":"That's right.","w":0.097444082895914691},{"c":1,"t":"OK. And we need the map of the seashore. You just left that to me. And I had to do","y":0.44331395365400628,"w":0.70103093465169275,"x":0.12371133664559029,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"h":0.019153509851210337,"t":"it while the tide was low, well that was OK, but the place I started it from was down.","w":0.70531972249348962,"c":1,"x":0.12569973906308726,"y":0.45762068149730295},{"x":0.85842733927920067,"w":0.039846353530883838,"y":0.45713712928489336,"t":"Q25","c":1,"h":0.015958299933639064},{"w":0.70515462239583326,"t":"on the beach, then I realised I should have gone up higher to get better vis ibility, so","y":0.47529069771878008,"x":0.12371134869899057,"c":1,"h":0.014534883616744709},{"t":"Thad to start all over again. But at least I'd got the squared paper or I'd have had","y":0.49100820978332749,"w":0.68465037027994802,"h":0.017202107400944633,"c":1,"x":0.12365959311004852},{"c":1,"y":0.50730241220433259,"x":0.12362953121729248,"w":0.27031489054361979,"h":0.0145459614707244,"t":"problems drawing it all to scale."},{"c":1,"w":0.6907216389973958,"x":0.1237113453424747,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.52319436288652121,"t":"Yes. It looks good. We could get a map of the region off the internet and see if we"},{"x":0.12371133772406295,"h":0.011627907341393184,"t":"need to make any changes.","y":0.5406976742278542,"w":0.23917526245117188,"c":1},{"w":0.67628865559895834,"x":0.12164949354072689,"c":1,"y":0.55372871381603428,"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"I had a look but I couldn't find anything. But you took some pictures, didn't you?"},{"h":0.016924591534850375,"t":"Yeah. I'll email you them if you want.","w":0.30967529296875002,"y":0.56947695807247323,"x":0.12557192104574094,"c":1},{"h":0.016874109515707114,"c":1,"y":0.58714569881674583,"w":0.6413588460286459,"t":"OK. I'Il make my amendments using those then I can scan it into our report","x":0.12570706416487346},{"c":1,"t":"Q26","w":0.039175256093343047,"x":0.85567010380899855,"y":0.58866279059408388,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"h":0.015522610210210397,"t":"Great.","x":0.1228561267586272,"w":0.057494449615478532,"c":1,"y":0.6026676757740328},{"w":0.71134023030598958,"y":0.64386376955539215,"x":0.12371132804318118,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"Now when we get to our findings I thought we could divide them up into the different"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"zones we identified on the shore and the problems organisms face in each zone. So","y":0.65988372097968251,"w":0.71340204874674484,"x":0.12164949100957036},{"w":0.18762886047363281,"h":0.011752516118764711,"y":0.67732558120333441,"c":1,"t":"for the highest area ...","x":0.1237113428027025},{"y":0.69172836001359916,"h":0.015481302616390469,"x":0.12346642556663134,"w":0.17166975657145178,"c":1,"t":"... the splash zone?"},{"x":0.12363657877074748,"t":"Yeah, we found mostly those tiny shellfish that have strong hard shells that act as","y":0.70637129994138703,"w":0.68878870646158852,"c":1,"h":0.01898190223393692},{"c":1,"t":"protection.","w":0.093240826924641931,"x":0.12151768279652174,"h":0.014583397247619034,"y":0.72333020725982211},{"t":"But not from other organisms that might eat them, predators?","y":0.73982558156145251,"x":0.12371135163894706,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"w":0.51958760579427077},{"h":0.018311167351302116,"w":0.7175975545247395,"c":1,"x":0.12160891893977474,"t":"No, that's not the main danger for them. But the shells prevent them from drying out","y":0.75501923040580965},{"h":0.017510186764890134,"c":1,"t":"because they're in the open air for most of the lime.","w":0.43730600992838542,"x":0.12362581171386447,"y":0.77031851926127293},{"c":1,"h":0.017513142987272023,"w":0.72176284790039069,"t":"Right. And since they're exposed, they need to be able to find some sort of shelter, or","y":0.78633723585468707,"x":0.12365448562377993},{"t":"cover themselves up, so they don't get too hot. Then in the middle and lower zones,","w":0.71340204874674484,"y":0.80377906992341952,"x":0.12164949110085445,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.8197298886497475,"w":0.54432988484700517,"t":"nearer the sea, we need to discuss the effects of wave action...","c":1,"x":0.12164949046852125},{"c":1,"y":0.83575581412047939,"w":0.71752578735351569,"t":"Yes, and how organisms develop structures to prevent themselves from being swept","x":0.12164947735417002,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"away, or even destroyed by being smashed against the rocks.","h":0.017123506269382194,"y":0.85074620822739899,"c":1,"x":0.1215822497715431,"w":0.52589360555013021},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"w":0.71340204874674484,"x":0.11752577964724613,"y":0.86758661197629217,"t":"I haven't done anything on the geological changes. I don't know what to put for that."},{"t":"No, we weren't concentrating on that. Maybe we need to find some websites.","x":0.12164948521140483,"c":1,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.8837209303991217,"w":0.65360824584960941},{"w":0.6805906677246093,"h":0.018186698013099578,"y":0.89816824324302535,"x":0.12362016947169717,"c":1,"t":"Good idea. I've got the lecture notes from Mr Blake's geology course, but they re"},{"c":1,"y":0.91569767452641215,"t":"too general. But we could ask him which books on our Reading List might be most","h":0.015988371754420583,"w":0.70103093465169275,"x":0.11958762345924488},{"y":0.93168604641837172,"w":0.063917522430419912,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"helpful.","x":0.12164948626932613},{"w":0.29359578450520835,"c":1,"h":0.024087541885958297,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35215856071532631,"y":0.95285749046111035},{"w":0.082828172047932913,"h":0.014237038191808216,"x":0.85549313036732011,"y":0.75378264367903236,"t":"Q27 & 28","c":1},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.082474225362141884,"x":0.85567010371332497,"y":0.8037790696855549,"c":1,"t":"Q27 & 28"},{"x":0.90927835016663872,"t":"111","w":0.037113402684529673,"y":0.94912790685216741,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3406}